 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"37\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"165\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">문제풀이 동영상<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">(6개 대기업/그룹)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"37\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"369\">\n            <p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;새굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">삼성, STX, 두산, SK, 현대기아자동차, 한화</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p><br><strong>[이용방법]<br></strong>취업정보센터 사이트 접속 &gt; 회원가입 &gt; 로그인&nbsp;&gt; 대기업 직무적성검사 클릭<br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">문의&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">취업정보센터 478-7211~2 </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
